      "text": "Ilyra distinguishes Damar’s earlier shipping receipt from Lock Prefect Vaelor’s later destination instruction: the earlier-issued seal gives the redirected destination authority. His record says received, but his chosen arrival never happened. Preserve both records and his account. This is a concrete routing convention, not proof that every institu"
