      "hour": 18.071913276628617,
      "kind": "atlantis-campaign",
      "text": "Operate the supplied manual bypass from the wet east lane. It stops only this accepted repair’s shallow current; the public air court and downstream visitor supply remain maintained. The three required inlet, equalizer and outlet stages still need their own correct operations. There is no hidden timing penalty, material loss, enemy-stat change or e"
    },
