      "kind": "atlantis-campaign",
      "text": "Set match-depth-bands at Bellglass’s dry control desk after inlet isolation. The chosen reading and maintained depth chart establish the bands. Keep the public air volume supplied. This is the second required pressure stage, with no timing penalty or forced simultaneous switches."
    },
